    <defName>RPC_Adult_Corpo</defName>
    <title>corpo</title>
    <titleShort>corpo</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] climbed the corporate ladder one backstab at a time. [PAWN_pronoun] knows how to read a room, a contract and a threat.</description>
